Looks like educationlevel isn't a factor: check your data with str() and if necessary use factor(), e.g.:

Data$educationlevel <- factor(Data$educationlevel)
levels(Data$educationlevel) # check hte levels, and see if "Primary" if first. If not...

Data$educationlevel <- factor(Data$educationlevel, levels=c("Primary", "secondary", "Tertiary"))

Bob

